    "timeSpreadNote": "Ages are spread so every recency chip changes what the map shows: most reports within 1 h (the live demo), seed-report-008 at 100 min (3h chip), 005 at 8 h (24h chip), 013 at ~26 h and 010 at 14 days (Kailanman only). The SX pair (018/019) must stay minutes old: the S0 half decays with a 60-min tau and drops under the 0.5 conflict threshold ~42 min after its own timestamp. Offsets are still re-applied on every cold start (SeedLoader), so a seed's age is relative to app launch, not a real submission time. Three more (020-022) were added 22 Sep 2026 on real Mapandan, Pangasinan streets, all under an hour old."
